hape="124"><CHAR>ㅇㅇㅇ</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="124"><CHAR>(한국)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="13" ColAddr="4" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2686" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="13866"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="16" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="124"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="18" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2686" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="5943"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="16" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="124"><CHAR>일반</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="124"><CHAR>* 청년: 19세 이상 34세 이하인 사람을 말함(청년기본법)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  (2) 주관/공동연구개발기관별 일자리 창출 계획</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="127" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>   ※ 주관</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="192"><CHAR>/공동연구개발기관별 일자리 창출 계획, 채용 예정 인원 및 채용 방법 등에 대해 서술</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="191"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    [주관연구개발기관(기관명 기입)]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    [공동연구개발기관1(기관명 기입)]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    [공동연구개발기관2(기관명 기입)]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    -</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>   3-5. 실증설비 구축 및 운영방안</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="169"><CHAR>  </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR> ※ 실증형 연구개발과제에 한하여 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="12" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="163"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>     (1) 실증사이트 확보 방안</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="366"><CHAR>(실증설비 설치․운영 장소(전용공간) 명시)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="427" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>   ※ 연구개발계획서상에 명시된 전용공간 이외의 장소에 실증설비를 설치․운영하고자 하는 경우 주관연구개발기관은 사전에 서면으로 요청하여 전문기관의 승인을 득하여야 함. 이때 변경타당성 검토를 위한 현장점검, 특별평가위원회 심의 등이 이루어질 수 있음</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="192"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="365"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="31" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><TABLE BorderFill="2" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="2" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="2"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="2069246089" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="123"><SIZE Height="12752" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="33474" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="10338" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="16737"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="31" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="382"><CHAR>실증사이트 사진 또는 조감도</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="10338" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="16737"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="31" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="382"><CHAR>실증사이트 사진 또는 조감도</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2414" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="33474"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="31" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="382"><CHAR>실증사이트 명(주소 포함)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>     (2) 실증설비 구축방안</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>     (3) 실증설비 운영방안 및 운영기간</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="127" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>   ※ 연구개발기간 중 실증설비의 운영방안(운영주체 등)과 운영기간에 대해 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o (운영방안)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="136"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o (운영기간)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>     (4) 연구개발과제종료 후 실증설비 관리 및 자립화 방안</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="127" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>   ※ 총연구개발기간 종료 후 실증설비의 관리방안과 자립화 방안을 구체적으로 기재</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="192"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o (과제종료 후 실증설비 관리방안)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>       o (자립화 방안) </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="39"><CHAR>※ 구체적으로 기재</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>        - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>        - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>        - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="138" Style="177"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>4. 연구개발성과의 활용방안 및 기대효과</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="127"/></P><P ParaShape="138" Style="177"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="177"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR> 4-1. 연구개발성과의 활용방안</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="254" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="342"><CHAR>   </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="200"><CHAR>※ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="347"><CHAR>AI R&amp;D 과제의 경우, AI 활용 결과물을 활용한 연구활동, 사업화, 후속연구 등 활용방안 추가 제시</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>   [예상되는 연구개발 주요 성과]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>   [연구개발 성과의 활용분야 및 활용방안]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="177"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="177"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR> 4-2. 연구개발성과의 기대효과</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>   [과학⋅기술적 측면]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="383" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="338"><CHAR>   </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>※ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="345"><CHAR>AI R&amp;D 과제의 경우, AI 활용 결과물을 활용한 연구분야 확대, 후속연구 등 과학 기술적 측면 기대효과 추가 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>   [경제적<FWSPACE/>․<FWSPACE/> 사회적 측면]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="254" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="338"><CHAR>   </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>※ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="166"><CHAR>AI R&amp;D 과제의 경우, AI 활용 결과물을 활용한 사업화 연계 등 기대효과 추가 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="212"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="212"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>   [인프라 측면]</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="384" Style="183"><TEXT CharShape="338"><CHAR>   </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="107"><CHAR>※ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="346"><CHAR>AI R&amp;D 과제의 경우, AI 활용 결과물을 활용한 인프라 측면에서의</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="166"><CHAR> 기대효과 추가 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="100"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>  o </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR>    - </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="177"><TEXT CharShape="93"><TABLE BorderFill="12" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="2" PageBreak="None" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="2"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1649264786" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="53"><SIZE Height="18231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="48466" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="284" Left="284" Right="284" Top="284"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="22" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2254" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="8897"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="24" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="3"><CHAR>작성 요령</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="79" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2254" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="39569"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="141" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="22"><CHAR> 연구개발계획서 작성 후 작성 요령 표는 삭제</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="17" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="2" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="15977" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="48466"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="90" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>◦</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="249"><CHAR> 연구개발성과의 활용방안: 연구개발과제 수행에 따라 예상되는 연구개발성과와 그 활용분야 및 활용방안을 기재</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="229" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>  - </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="249"><CHAR>기술적 측면은 해당 기술의 향상, 다른 기술로의 파급 효과 및 기술개발에 따른 에너지 절약 또는 환경 개선</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR> 효과 등을 서술</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="126" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="17"/></P><P ParaShape="230" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>◦ 연구개발성과의 기대효과: 연구개발성과의 과학ㆍ기술적, 경제ㆍ사회적, 인프라 측면에서 기대효과ㆍ파급효과 등을 기재</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="231" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>⦁(과학적 성과) 학문 분야 편차를 보완한 표준화된 영향력 지수, 피인용 지수 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="231" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>⦁(기술적 성과) 표준 특허, 3극 특허, 특허의 잠재적 가치(발명진흥회 SMART, 특허정보원 K-PEG 등), 국제 표준 채택 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="231" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>⦁(경제적 성과) 기술료, 매출액 기여, 수입대체 효과, 원가절감 기여, 고용 창출 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="231" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>⦁(사회적 성과) 해당분야 졸업자 수, 추가고용규모, 정책활용도, 언론 홍보건수 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="231" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>⦁(인프라 성과) 장비 공동 활용률, 성능 달성도, 시험 인증 통과 여부 등</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><CHAR> 4-3. 연구개발성과의 기술기여도 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="98"><CHAR>※ 기술료 납부 의무기관만</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="96"><CHAR> 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="38"><TABLE BorderFill="2" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="6" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="4"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1608764226" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="42"><SIZE Height="9433" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="48118" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="95" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="5055" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="2" Width="7218"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>연구개발</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>기관명</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="96" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="5" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2447" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="40900"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>기술기여도</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="34"><CHAR>(단위: %)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="31" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2608" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8180"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>매출액발생</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>1년차</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="31" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2608" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8180"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>매출액발생</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>2년차</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="31" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2608" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8180"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>매출액발생</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>3년차</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="31" ColAddr="4" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2608" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8180"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>매출액발생</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>4년차</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="100" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2608" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="8180"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="52" Style="173"><TEXT CharShape