kListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="58" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="14" ColAddr="8" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1775" Protect="false" RowAddr="25" RowSpan="1" Width="4420"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="58" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="14" ColAddr="9" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1775" Protect="false" RowAddr="25" RowSpan="1" Width="4420"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="58" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="49" ColAddr="10" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1775" Protect="false" RowAddr="25" RowSpan="1" Width="4703"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="58" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="34"/></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="151" Style="175"><TEXT CharShape="44"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="151" Style="175"><TEXT CharShape="44"><CHAR>1) 총 인건비 : 내부인건비 + 외부인건비 + 연구근접지원인력인건비 + 학생인건비</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="151" Style="175"><TEXT CharShape="44"><CHAR> 2) 수정인건비 : 내부인건비 + 외부인건비 + 학생인건비</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="151" Style="175"><TEXT CharShape="44"><CHAR> 3) 연구수당 비율 : (연구수당/수정인건비)*100</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="151" Style="175"><TEXT CharShape="44"><CHAR> 4) 간접비 비율 : (간접비/수정직접비)*100,   * </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="225"><CHAR>수정직접비</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="44"><CHAR> = 직접비 소계 - 직접비(현물) - 국제공동연구개발비</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="20"/></P><P ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="151"><CHAR> </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="3" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="40"><CHAR> o 참여연구자 인건비 현황표(1차년도 기준으로 작성)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="268" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="22"><CHAR>  ※ 현금 인건비 산정 사유(영리기관이 현금 인건비 계상시에만 작성) : 중소기업 신규채용, 인건비 현금인정분야, 연구개발서비스업 등</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="268" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="22"/></P><P ParaShape="188" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="21"><CHAR>※ 현금 인건비 산정 사유(영리기관이 현금 인건비 계상시 해당사항 모두 체크) </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="188" Style="15"><TEXT CharShape="325"><TABLE BorderFill="2" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="7"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="2065802798" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="121"><SIZE Height="17292" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="47905" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="140" Left="140" Right="140" Top="140"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="169" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1182" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3474"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="43" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>번호</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="169" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1182" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="38643"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="43" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>내용 (현금인건비 계상 사유)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="169" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="1182" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="5788"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="43" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>해당여부(√)</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3125" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="3474"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="43" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>1</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3125" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="38643"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="55" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="323"><CHAR>중소․중견기업인 연구개발기관이 신규로 채용하는 참여연구자(채용일부터 연구개발과제 공고일까지의</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR> 기간이 6개월 이내인 연구자를 포함)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="55" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="17"><CHAR>· 상기에 의거 채용한 신규 참여연구자 인건비 금액만큼 기존 참여연구자의 인건비</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="2" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3125" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="5788"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="510" Right="510" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkLi